---
/**
 * Overrides Starlight's Banner so the notice appears on every page, not only on
 * pages that set `banner` in frontmatter. sandboxr is documented alongside code
 * that is still being written, and a reader who lands mid-site from a search
 * result needs to know that before they copy a command.
 */
---

<div class="sl-banner">
  sandboxr is early. No project has been run in a sandbox yet, so treat every command as the
  intended behaviour rather than as observed behaviour.
  <a href="/reference/status/">What is built, honestly</a>.
</div>

<style>
  .sl-banner {
    --sl-banner-text: var(--sl-color-banner-text, var(--sl-color-white));
    padding: var(--sl-nav-pad-y) var(--sl-nav-pad-x);
    background-color: var(--sl-color-bg-accent);
    color: var(--sl-banner-text);
    line-height: var(--sl-line-height-headings);
    text-align: center;
    text-wrap: balance;
    box-shadow: var(--sl-shadow-sm);
  }

  .sl-banner a {
    color: var(--sl-banner-text);
  }
</style>
